  "rootCause": [
    "Global easing incorrectly moved keyframe boundaries instead of applying within each property interval.",
    "Keyframe-local timing metadata was painted and ignored as easing.",
    "CSS steps chose incorrect discontinuity sides and lacked jump-none/jump-both.",
    "Fractional iterations ran beyond the actual end."
  ],
  "change": "Select intervals from directed linear progress; apply keyframe-local or element easing per interval; use direction/phase before flag and correct fractional end.",
